{"header":{"OB_REQUEST_ID":"d4ad69db-7316-47ae-adc6-5480c2cea2b7","result.val":0,"http.code":200,"result.text":"OK"},"data":{"message":{"id":684874,"messageId":684874,"newsId":637471,"title":"Equinor ASA: Share buy-back - third tranche for 2026","body":"Please see below information about transactions made under the third tranche of\nthe 2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA (OSE:EQNR, NYSE:EQNR,\nCEUX:EQNRO, TQEX:EQNRO).\n\nDate on which the buy-back tranche was announced: 22 July 2026.\n\nThe duration of the buy-back tranche: 23 July to no later than 26 October 2026.\n\nFurther information on the tranche can be found in the stock market announcement\non its commencement dated 22 July 2026, available here:\nhttps://newsweb.oslobors.no/message/678529\n\nFrom 19 October to 22 October 2026, Equinor ASA has purchased a total of\n518,500 own shares at an average price of NOK 435.0082 per share.\n\nThe third tranche of the 2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA has now\nbeen completed.\n\nOverview of transactions:\n\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Date             |Trading    |              |       Daily|                    |\n|                 |venue      |    Aggregated|    weighted|                    |\n|                 |           |  daily volume|     average|         Total daily|\n|                 |           |    (number of| share price|   transaction value|\n|                 |           |       shares)|       (NOK)|               (NOK)|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|19 October       |OSE        |       128,000|    437.5732|       56,009,369.60|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|20 October       |OSE        |       130,000|    435.7075|       56,641,975.00|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|21 October       |OSE        |       131,000|    430.0386|       56,335,056.60|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|22 October       |OSE        |       129,500|    436.7980|       56,565,341.00|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Total for the    |OSE        |              |            |                    |\n|period           |           |       518,500|    435.0082|      225,551,742.20|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Previously       |OSE        |     8,238,107|    398.4234|    3,282,254,732.19|\n|disclosed buy-   +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|backs under the  |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n|tranche          +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |Total      |     8,238,107|    398.4234|    3,282,254,732.19|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Total buy-backs  |OSE        |     8,756,607|    400.5897|    3,507,806,474.39|\n|under the tranche+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|(accumulated)    |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |Total      |     8,756,607|    400.5897|    3,507,806,474.39|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n\n\nFollowing completion of the above transactions, Equinor ASA owns a total of\n23,595,817 own shares, corresponding to 0.99% of Equinor ASA's share capital,\nincluding shares under Equinor's share savings programme (excluding shares under\nEquinor's share savings programme, Equinor owns a total of 12,291,582 own\nshares, corresponding to 0.51% of the share capital).\n\nThis is information that Equinor ASA is obliged to make public pursuant to the\nEU Market Abuse Regulation and that is subject to the disclosure requirements\npursuant to Section 5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act.\n\nAppendix: An overview of all transactions made under the buy-back tranche that\nhave been carried out during the above-mentioned time period is attached to this\nreport and available at www.newsweb.no.\n\nContact details:\n\nInvestor relations\nBård Glad Pedersen, senior vice president Investor Relations,\n+47 918 01 791\n\nMedia\nSissel Rinde, vice president Media Relations,\n+47 412 60 584\n","category":[{"id":1007,"category_no":"UTSTEDERS MELDEPLIKT VED HANDEL I EGNE AKSJER","category_en":"ACQUISITION OR DISPOSAL OF AN ISSUER'S OWN SHARES"}],"markets":["XOSL"],"issuerId":1309,"correctionForMessageId":0,"correctedByMessageId":0,"issuerSign":"EQNR","issuerName":"Equinor ASA","instrId":0,"instrumentName":"","instrumentFullName":"","publishedTime":"2026-10-27T07:00:09.869Z","test":false,"numbAttachments":1,"attachments":[{"id":335064,"name":"Detailed overview of transactions.pdf"}],"clientAnnouncementId":"78255dd9-5837-4709-8271-c1a3e914a245","infoRequired":1,"oamMandatory":1}}}